 \Big|\E_{(\line, \line_X, \line_Z) \sim D} \E_{(x,z,\alpha, \beta) \in \line} &\sum_{f_X, f_Z} \bra{\hat{\psi}} T^{\line_X, \line_Z}_{f_X, f_Z} \ot \hat{M}^{(\Point,Z),z}_{f_Z(z)} (\Id-\hat{M}^{(\Point,X),x}_{f_X(x)} ) \ket{\hat{\psi}}\Big|\\
