where we used the shorthand $T^{\line_X, \line_Z,x}_{a} = \sum_{f_X,f_Z: f_X(x)=a} T^{\line_X, \line_Z}_{f_X, f_Z}$ and the second equality uses that $\{\hat{M}^{(\Point,X),x}_{a}\}$ is a projective measurement. Using the definition 
